      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，我身为训练员，\n也必须尽力让目白阿尔丹\n能够回应她们的期待……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0f3be092e98346a9216abc630037f6cb508d617ea9cdfe413f7d47a508c4d2",
